<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Shrei</title><description>底层技术分析与实现过程，覆盖逆向工程、图形驱动栈、游戏引擎、操作系统内核与渲染管线设计</description><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/</link><language>zh-CN</language><item><title>主机权威、同步屏障与种子对账：Helldivers 2 的联机同步模型</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/43-helldivers2-network-synchronization/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/43-helldivers2-network-synchronization/</guid><description>Helldivers 2 的联机不是服务器下发世界，而是一名 peer 持有会话权威、其余 peer 在同步屏障上对齐、地图靠同一 seed 各自本地生成再哈希对账。本文用运行时映像里的字符串锚点、函数区间和指令序列，把主机权威、加入状态机、同步屏障、确定性对账、主机迁移和复制目标逐层钉到具体 RVA 上。</description><pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>游戏系统设计</category><category>Networking</category><category>Multiplayer</category><category>Host Migration</category><category>Determinism</category><category>State Machine</category></item><item><title>预制池、种子与烘焙：Helldivers 2 地图生成流水线</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/42-helldivers2-map-generation-pipeline/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/42-helldivers2-map-generation-pipeline/</guid><description>Helldivers 2 的地图不是固定成品图，也不是纯噪声地形，而是预制资源池 + seed 驱动的空间重组 + 每局地形烘焙。Steam Build 24036910 上，五段连续生成函数、几十个 pass 名、资源等待点和 level_generation 插件接缝，构成了完整的客户端流水线。</description><pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>游戏系统设计</category><category>Procedural Generation</category><category>Level Design</category><category>Stingray</category><category>Seed</category><category>Plugin ABI</category></item><item><title>只用拓扑不变量，验证一张程序化生成的球面分区图</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/41-spherical-voronoi-topology-validation/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/41-spherical-voronoi-topology-validation/</guid><description>Helldivers 2 的 26 张星球 territory 图共享同一组数字：512 个 cell、1530 条边、1020 个 corner、度数和 3060。给定 512 个输入点，其余每个数字都被球面 Euler 公式和 Voronoi/Delaunay 对偶锁死。本文推导这组闭式不变量，并给出一份可执行的检查清单。</description><pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形渲染</category><category>Procedural Generation</category><category>Spherical Voronoi</category><category>Delaunay</category><category>Computational Geometry</category><category>Stingray</category></item><item><title>如何实现Hell Diver 2 的Heat Haze着色效果</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/40-helldivers2-heat-haze-shader/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/40-helldivers2-heat-haze-shader/</guid><description>Heat Haze 是一种基于线性深度、视线方向和三维噪声的屏幕后处理效果。文章给出两阶段结构、参考参数、数学流程，以及 WebGL 复现边界。</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形渲染</category><category>Stingray</category><category>Shader</category><category>Heat Haze</category><category>Post Processing</category><category>WebGL</category></item><item><title>性能数字的口径：为什么几段毫秒不能相加</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/38-performance-number-scope/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/38-performance-number-scope/</guid><description>终末地公开分享里的「Render Path 约 1ms」经常被转述成「渲染优化到 1ms」，后者几乎总是错的——1ms 只覆盖提交路径，而转述者想表达的是整帧。帧率、模块耗时、候选压缩比、分批开销分别描述管线的不同段落，各自的测试上下文也不同。本文用一组公开分享的数字说明口径怎么被合并、为什么托管层的统计对不上这些毫秒，以及一个没被采纳的方案为什么也要标价。</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>游戏系统设计</category><category>Performance</category><category>Benchmark</category><category>Rendering</category><category>ECS</category><category>Evidence</category></item><item><title>字段名不是语义：读写交叉引用才是最低门槛</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/37-field-name-is-not-semantics/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/37-field-name-is-not-semantics/</guid><description>终末地自研 ECS 的 archetype 描述符里有一个叫 fence 的 u32，但这不等于同步协议已经还原。名字相近的三组线索——描述符字段、事件分发方法、UI 工具层 API——很容易被并成一套协议，而把它们连起来的证据其实一条都没有。本文用一次真实的归属误判说明，读写交叉引用才是语义的最低门槛，以及函数边界数据库为什么必须先于反汇编片段。</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>游戏系统设计</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>ECS</category><category>Synchronization</category><category>Evidence</category><category>Unity</category></item><item><title>无神经网络的主体概率场：边框种子、门控扩散与极性锁</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/36-subject-field-without-neural-network/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/36-subject-field-without-neural-network/</guid><description>主体概率若来自神经网络，效果就取决于模型文件、运行时和输入分布。要一条完全本地、可解释的路径，就得从图像本身构造主体场：稳健边框统计给出背景种子，Lab 色差门控的有限轮扩散建立连通关系，频率调谐与 MIP 中心-外围提供两种对比证据，填充程度调节两者权重，最后锁定主体极性。本文拆解为什么单一证据必然翻车、迭代轮数为何是合同而非调参，并划清它与 JFA、神经分割的边界。</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形渲染</category><category>Image Processing</category><category>Saliency</category><category>LAB</category><category>ASCII Art</category><category>Computer Vision</category><category>Mathematical Morphology</category></item><item><title>卡片箔面材质的数据化分层与 GPU 测量</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/35-card-foil-data-driven-material-profile/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/35-card-foil-data-driven-material-profile/</guid><description>为每种稀有度复制一份箔面材质，层之间会逐渐分叉：一个 profile 修了彩虹采样，另一个仍用旧公式。相反的结构是只保留一套 WebGL2 ShaderMaterial，稀有度差异全部下沉到数据化的 RarityProfile 与纹理 mask。本文拆解这套分层如何保持可解释，以及调试视图、确定性 seed、色彩空间与 timer query 各自划出的可验证边界。</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形渲染</category><category>WebGL2</category><category>GLSL</category><category>Shader</category><category>Material</category><category>Data Driven</category><category>GPU Profiling</category></item><item><title>面向 Agent 的持久代码索引：快照式增量、符号级读取与置信边界</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/34-persistent-code-index-for-agents/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/34-persistent-code-index-for-agents/</guid><description>Agent 反复扫盘和读取整文件会消耗上下文，也无法稳定处理引用关系。把文件、符号、import、调用图和质量元数据写进持久数据库，冷启动复用已有索引、文件事件只重算受影响记录，导航就能降到「一个定义加一圈影响面」。本文拆解快照式增量为什么必须优于逐事件更新、三类搜索各自的成本曲线，以及静态索引在动态语言与生成代码上的语义边界。</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>MCP 架构</category><category>AI Agent</category><category>MCP</category><category>Code Index</category><category>SQLite</category><category>Incremental Build</category><category>Developer Tools</category></item><item><title>让模型写有状态宿主：把不可逆动作拆成可检查的状态转换</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/33-agent-safe-graph-editing-protocol/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/33-agent-safe-graph-editing-protocol/</guid><description>给模型读权限和写权限，失败模式完全不同。读的失败是答错了，写的失败是调用成功却留下没人能解释的中间状态。安全性不来自沙箱，而来自四条约束：能力必须运行时发现、参数 schema 必须从执行体派生、干跑无法诚实模拟时必须拒绝、写后差异属于协议而非调用方礼仪。本文用引擎图编辑作证据，也说明协议买不到什么。</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>MCP 架构</category><category>MCP</category><category>AI Agent</category><category>Protocol Design</category><category>Unreal Engine</category><category>Graph Editing</category><category>Safety</category></item><item><title>双后端管线的中间表示：确定性起点与有界精修</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/32-dual-backend-intermediate-representation/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/32-dual-backend-intermediate-representation/</guid><description>实时后端与可微后端各自产出结果图时，任何画面差异都无法归因，也无法跨后端重放。可行的做法是在两者之间放一份版本化的强类型中间表示：实时分支给出确定性起点，精修分支只做有界增量，材质终局只实现一次。本文用一条 D3D12 + PyTorch/CUDA 的油画化管线作证据，拆解这份跨后端合同、光谱颜料语义与缓存失效边界。</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形渲染</category><category>D3D12</category><category>CUDA</category><category>PyTorch</category><category>Intermediate Representation</category><category>Differentiable Rendering</category><category>Shader</category></item><item><title>终末地角色湿润 Shader：逐 Draw ABI 与三类材质坐标</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/31-endfield-character-wetness-shader/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/31-endfield-character-wetness-shader/</guid><description>终末地的角色湿润由一条跨控制器、参数 blob 与 Shader 的链路驱动。水体、雨水与玩法湿润先编码进 CustomPerDrawData，衣服用稳定角色坐标三平面生成水滴和流痕，面部沿模型 UV 做双相位滴流，头发则由 packed wet 标量驱动程序化湿膜与各向异性高光。这条链必须由控制器实参、参数 blob 与 DXBC 三类证据交叉才能闭合。</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形逆向</category><category>Unity</category><category>Shader</category><category>DXBC</category><category>Wetness</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Rendering</category></item><item><title>渲染事实闭包：资源版本化、反向切片与首分歧验证</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/30-render-fact-closure-first-divergence/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/30-render-fact-closure-first-divergence/</guid><description>一次图形捕获只有在资源读写被版本化、目标输出能反向追到全部生产者、原始 Blob 与派生解释分离，并可按检查点定位首个分歧时，才成为可重放的渲染事实。本文拆解这条闭包链的四层结构、每一层的阻塞判据，以及「单次捕获闭合」与「方法覆盖完整」之间的边界。</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形逆向</category><category>Graphics</category><category>D3D11</category><category>D3D12</category><category>Frame Capture</category><category>Replay</category><category>Render Graph</category></item><item><title>代码虚拟化的判定与兼容复现边界</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/29-code-virtualization-climb-or-bypass/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/29-code-virtualization-climb-or-bypass/</guid><description>需要的算法体落在一个虚拟化保护的节里，去虚拟化并不总是正确的第一步。本文用独立证据确认虚拟化归属，再按目标区分语义恢复与兼容复现，给出候选实现、强判据、独立约束和全量样本构成的决策边界，并以终末地 UnityPlayer 的 .tvm0 作为案例。</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Unity 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Virtualization</category><category>Anti-Analysis</category><category>Methodology</category><category>Unity</category></item><item><title>Archetype ECS 的两个边界：渲染提交与流式列补写</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/28-archetype-ecs-render-streaming-boundary/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/28-archetype-ecs-render-streaming-boundary/</guid><description>上一篇把这套自研 Archetype ECS 的列存储和查询切分拆开了，正文停在双 World。这一篇接着走列数据的两个边界——出口到 GPU 的渲染提交，入口从磁盘的流式补写。两个边界都有一层可验证的托管 ABI，也都在某个位置沉进不可见的原生层；本文把托管这一侧讲透，并明确标出原生底在哪。</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>游戏系统设计</category><category>Unity</category><category>ECS</category><category>Archetype</category><category>Rendering</category><category>Serialization</category></item><item><title>终末地资源的两层保护：判据、排除矩阵与兼容复现</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/27-endfield-vfs-two-layer-analysis/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/27-endfield-vfs-two-layer-analysis/</guid><description>从&quot;MD5 校验通过但 UnityPy 枚举出 0 个对象&quot;这一矛盾出发，区分 VFS 文件层与 AssetBundle 归档层。记录 key、counter、处理顺序和压缩方言的排除矩阵，以及算法体落入 .tvm0 后如何用强判据、独立约束和全量样本形成兼容实现。</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Unity 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Unity</category><category>IL2CPP</category><category>AssetBundle</category><category>ChaCha20</category><category>LZ4</category><category>Methodology</category></item><item><title>有限调色板的色域预算与区域相位色点</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/26-pixel-art-palette-budget/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/26-pixel-art-palette-budget/</guid><description>像素画的调色板只有 16 个名额时，纯误差驱动的 K-means 会把小面积高价值颜色吸进大簇——因为重建误差正比于面积。可行的替换是把「该保什么」显式化为色相、冷暖、明度三层预算并锁定名额；落色阶段则放弃全局 Bayer，改按区域相位组织色点。本文拆解这两层各自的判据与失败模式。</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形渲染</category><category>Pixel Art</category><category>Palette</category><category>Dithering</category><category>Color Science</category></item><item><title>像素画重绘的区域优先架构：碎斑的成因与区域连续性</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/25-pixel-art-region-first-architecture/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/25-pixel-art-region-first-architecture/</guid><description>照片与插画缩成低分辨率像素画时，逐像素采样必然产生碎斑，根源是每个输出格独立决策。可行的处理是把顺序反过来：先在工作分辨率上形成连续色块再投票写入输出网格，而需要在低分辨率存活的小特征必须在区域合并之前介入。本文拆解这条链的六个阶段、结构锚点的介入时机，以及区域双色模型与线性光混色的边界。</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形渲染</category><category>Pixel Art</category><category>Image Processing</category><category>Superpixel</category><category>LAB</category></item><item><title>确定性刷怪导演系统的结构设计</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/39-spawn-director-design/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/39-spawn-director-design/</guid><description>把刷怪拆成确定性随机、带占用修正的候选加权选择、性能账本与容量门禁的双账本、生命周期驱动的显式回收和带原因码的状态机，得到一个可复现、分布合理、数量有界的刷怪导演系统。</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>游戏系统设计</category><category>Spawn System</category><category>AI Director</category><category>Determinism</category><category>State Machine</category><category>Game Design</category></item><item><title>运行态角色贴图的外部提取：draw 抓取、格式解码与外观复现</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/24-runtime-texture-extraction/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/24-runtime-texture-extraction/</guid><description>从已知的 Unity GameObject 沿 Renderer、Material 与 Texture2D 提取运行态角色贴图；CPU 侧拿不到的像素再抓某趟 draw 从显存读回。记录实际字段偏移、抓取时序、格式解码、行序归一化与着色器染色复现。</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Unity 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Unity</category><category>Graphics</category><category>D3D11</category><category>Texture</category><category>Shader</category></item><item><title>一种有意思的 Archetype ECS 的设计与取舍</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/22-archetype-ecs-design/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/22-archetype-ecs-design/</guid><description>在大型 Unity 项目里，除了官方 DOTS，还有一种自成体系的 Archetype ECS。128 位定长掩码、值类型 EntityManager、编译期注册、逻辑与渲染双 World。本文按存储、迁移、查询切分和双 World 同步把这套取舍拆开。</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>游戏系统设计</category><category>Unity</category><category>ECS</category><category>Archetype</category><category>DOTS</category><category>Architecture</category></item><item><title>运行态角色模型的外部提取：双路径架构、身份校验与顶点数据审计</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/23-runtime-model-extraction/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/23-runtime-model-extraction/</guid><description>从已知的 Unity GameObject 出发提取运行态角色的网格、骨骼与 UV，主体沿组件、Renderer 与 Mesh 做外部只读解析，只在显存独占的顶点缓冲上补一次最小 GPU readback。记录关键字段偏移、身份校验、骨骼姿态语义与顶点数据审计。</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Unity 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Unity</category><category>IL2CPP</category><category>Mesh</category><category>Skeleton</category><category>GPU Readback</category></item><item><title>SiNiSistar 2 资源加密逆向：Rijndael-256-CBC 的完整解密链路</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/21-sinisistar2-ab-decryption/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/21-sinisistar2-ab-decryption/</guid><description>SiNiSistar 2 的 2931 个 AssetBundle 全部被自定义加密保护，AssetStudio、UnityPy 都读不了。本文从 dump.cs 定位加密类，反汇编确认 Rijndael-256-CBC-PKCS7 参数，用 Frida 抓运行时密钥，最后发现代码里 IV 与 K 两个字段名是反的——按字面意思用会得到乱码。</description><pubDate>Mon, 29 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Unity 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Unity</category><category>IL2CPP</category><category>AssetBundle</category><category>Rijndael</category><category>Frida</category></item><item><title>高度场驱动的 WebGL 折射与接缝过渡</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/20-starlake-wallpaper-refraction-seam/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/20-starlake-wallpaper-refraction-seam/</guid><description>壁纸在水面波动时产生折射扭曲，壁纸和正文之间有一段平滑过渡带而不是硬切。这两个效果都在一个 fragment shader 里完成，靠高度场纹理驱动位移，靠 CSS 变量控制色调。</description><pubDate>Sat, 20 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形渲染</category><category>WebGL</category><category>GLSL</category><category>Shader</category><category>Canvas</category></item><item><title>二维波动方程的数值模拟：Canvas 上的水面高度场</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/19-starlake-wavefield-fluid-sim/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/19-starlake-wavefield-fluid-sim/</guid><description>博客背景的水面波动是跑在 Canvas 上的二维波动方程数值解。从离散化公式、双缓冲、高斯扰动注入、视口剔除到风场驱动，拆开一个水面模拟系统的每一层。</description><pubDate>Fri, 19 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形渲染</category><category>Canvas</category><category>WebGL</category><category>Fluid Simulation</category><category>Wave Equation</category></item><item><title>UE 四件套反射调用链：GNames / GObjects / GWorld / ProcessEvent</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/18-ue-four-piece-reflection-chain/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/18-ue-four-piece-reflection-chain/</guid><description>UE 逆向四件套 GNames、GObjects、GWorld、ProcessEvent 的反射调用链结构解析。</description><pubDate>Thu, 18 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>UE 逆向</category><category>Unreal Engine</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Reflection</category><category>GNames</category><category>GObjects</category><category>GWorld</category><category>ProcessEvent</category></item><item><title>无设备对象内核驱动：控制面、会话生命周期与诊断边界</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/17-device-object-free-kernel-driver-control-plane/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/17-device-object-free-kernel-driver-control-plane/</guid><description>无设备对象不是少写一个设备对象，而是把设备对象原本提供的发现入口、会话句柄、命令边界、返回状态和生命周期语义，显式转移到项目自己的协议、状态机和资源清理模型里。</description><pubDate>Wed, 17 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Windows 内核</category><category>Windows</category><category>Kernel Driver</category><category>WDM</category><category>Control Plane</category><category>Driver Design</category></item><item><title>IL2CPP Internal Call：UnityAPI惰性加载与初始化路径分析</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/16-il2cpp-internal-call-resolution/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/16-il2cpp-internal-call-resolution/</guid><description>IL2CPP 的部分 UnityEngine API 不在 GameAssembly 中直接实现，而是通过 internal call 按名字惰性加载到 UnityPlayer 的 native 函数。以 UnityEngine API 为例，拆开 generated wrapper 惰性缓存、InternalCalls::Resolve、UnityPlayer 注册表和 native 落点之间的完整链路。</description><pubDate>Tue, 16 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Unity 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Unity</category><category>IL2CPP</category><category>GameAssembly</category><category>UnityPlayer</category></item><item><title>UE 三面映射材质：坐标投影、方向权重与材质层组织</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/15-ue-triplanar-material/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/15-ue-triplanar-material/</guid><description>三面映射不是一个单独的贴图技巧，而是一组围绕空间坐标、法线权重、纹理采样、法线重定向和材质层混合展开的材质结构。本文按笔记形式整理 UE 三面映射材质的节点职责和组合数学。</description><pubDate>Mon, 15 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形渲染</category><category>Unreal Engine</category><category>Material</category><category>Triplanar</category><category>Shader</category><category>Rendering</category></item><item><title>Windows 内核异常分发：从 Trap Frame 到用户态处理链</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/14-windows-kernel-exception-dispatch/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/14-windows-kernel-exception-dispatch/</guid><description>用户态看到的 VEH/SEH（向量化/结构化异常处理）只是异常分发的下游。真正的入口在内核：CPU 异常进入内核保存 Trap Frame（陷阱帧），KiDispatchException 构造异常记录，经过调试器 first chance（第一次机会），再通过 KiUserExceptionDispatcher 进入用户态处理链。</description><pubDate>Sun, 14 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Windows 内核</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Windows</category><category>Kernel</category><category>Exception Handling</category><category>Trap Frame</category></item><item><title>UE5 Chaos 场景碰撞绘制：运行时碰撞数据读取与线框渲染</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/09-ue5-chaos-collision-wireframe/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/09-ue5-chaos-collision-wireframe/</guid><description>从运行时进程读取 UE5 Chaos 碰撞数据，结合 UObject 反射和启发式扫描，将碰撞形状转成可渲染线框。</description><pubDate>Sat, 13 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>UE 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Unreal Engine</category><category>UE5</category><category>Chaos</category><category>Collision</category></item><item><title>Windows 异常机制：异常上下文、分发顺序与可恢复执行</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/12-windows-exception-context-dispatch/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/12-windows-exception-context-dispatch/</guid><description>Windows 异常不是简单的崩溃通知，而是一套带线程上下文的分发机制。理解异常记录、上下文、VEH、SEH 和调试器路径，是分析断点、单步、Guard Page、反调试和控制流追踪的基础。</description><pubDate>Fri, 12 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Windows 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Windows</category><category>Exception Handling</category><category>VEH</category><category>SEH</category><category>Debugging</category></item><item><title>IL2CPP Registration 与字段偏移的运行时恢复</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/11-il2cpp-registration-runtime-recovery/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/11-il2cpp-registration-runtime-recovery/</guid><description>global-metadata.dat 只能恢复静态类型语义。要拿到字段偏移、方法地址和类型布局，还需要在 GameAssembly.dll 中定位 CodeRegistration 与 MetadataRegistration。</description><pubDate>Thu, 11 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Unity 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Unity</category><category>IL2CPP</category><category>Registration</category><category>GameAssembly</category></item><item><title>IL2CPP Metadata 的跨进程定位与类型系统恢复</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/10-il2cpp-metadata-recovery/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/10-il2cpp-metadata-recovery/</guid><description>外部工具处在 IL2CPP 内部 API 之外时，仍然可以利用 global-metadata.dat 的结构约束，在 GameAssembly.dll 的内存中定位 metadata，并恢复类型、字段、方法等静态语义。</description><pubDate>Wed, 10 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Unity 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Unity</category><category>IL2CPP</category><category>Metadata</category><category>GameAssembly</category></item><item><title>Unity IL2CPP 启动原理：从 UnityPlayer 到 GameAssembly 的初始化序列</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/01-il2cpp-init-deep-dive/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/01-il2cpp-init-deep-dive/</guid><description>双击运行 Unity 游戏时，引擎内部经历了一系列初始化序列，才能把 C# 代码真正运转起来。本文基于 Unity 2022.3.62 IL2CPP 产物的逆向分析，从 UnityPlayer 动态加载 GameAssembly 讲到 MetadataCache、Registration 表、类型索引、方法查询和内存布局。</description><pubDate>Tue, 09 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Unity 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Unity</category><category>IL2CPP</category><category>GameAssembly</category></item><item><title>IL2CPP 元数据表：从一张表还原 Unity 项目全貌</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/02-il2cpp-registration-counts/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/02-il2cpp-registration-counts/</guid><description>每个 IL2CPP 构建的 Unity 游戏，都在 GameAssembly.dll 里藏了一份记录 runtime 索引规模的表。本文教你读懂这份户口本，用真实数据量化项目复杂度。</description><pubDate>Mon, 08 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Unity 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Unity</category><category>IL2CPP</category><category>GameAssembly</category></item><item><title>Windows 控制流追踪：用硬件断点与 VEH 实现基本块级 trace</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/08-windows-dr-veh-control-flow-tracing/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/08-windows-dr-veh-control-flow-tracing/</guid><description>在 Windows x64 上用 DR0-DR3 硬件断点和 VEH 异常分发实现低开销基本块级控制流追踪。</description><pubDate>Sun, 07 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Windows 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Windows</category><category>Debug Register</category><category>VEH</category><category>Control Flow</category></item><item><title>本地桥接的传输选型：Server-First 与按进程命名的管道路由</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/13-local-bridge-named-pipe-routing/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/13-local-bridge-named-pipe-routing/</guid><description>标准 stdio 传输假设子进程由客户端拉起，但长期运行的编辑器进程先于客户端存在，且可能同时开着多个。可行的结构是两段式：外层保持 stdio 兼容，内层用按进程 PID 命名的本地管道解决生命周期、实例发现与路由。本文拆解这条链路的职责边界、长度前缀帧协议、多实例绑定与线程模型，并说明命名管道的适用范围。</description><pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>MCP 架构</category><category>MCP</category><category>IPC</category><category>Named Pipe</category><category>Unreal Engine</category><category>Server-First</category></item><item><title>MCP 上下文优化：数据压缩与按需加载——字典索引文本格式</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/07-mcp-context-optimization/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/07-mcp-context-optimization/</guid><description>MCP 对话的上下文窗口有限，但工具返回的数据天然膨胀。优化不是少返回字段，而是重新设计数据表示和加载策略。</description><pubDate>Fri, 05 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>MCP 架构</category><category>MCP</category><category>AI Tools</category><category>Context Optimization</category><category>Data Format</category></item><item><title>写操作的返回合同：让状态留在服务端</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/06-declarative-write-and-diff-token/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/06-declarative-write-and-diff-token/</guid><description>写操作返回「改完后的完整对象」，会让调用方被迫携带整个世界进入下一轮，而且状态一旦进了对话历史就再也不会失效。可行的替换是把返回合同改成声明式：响应只确认改了什么、改得对不对，完整状态留在服务端，调用方只持三种令牌。本文拆解这三种令牌各自解决什么问题，以及为什么「状态失效」必须由服务端主动判定。</description><pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>MCP 架构</category><category>MCP</category><category>AI Tools</category><category>Context Optimization</category><category>Protocol Design</category></item><item><title>Thin Facade MCP 工具设计：从 100 个 Operation 到 6 个 Tool</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/05-mcp-tool-design/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/05-mcp-tool-design/</guid><description>传统 MCP 的上下文压力来自两处：系统提示词中的工具定义 + 对话历史中的 tool result。Thin Facade 通过 6 个 facade 工具 + 内部 operation registry + response mode 控制，让 AI 决定加载什么、返回什么。</description><pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>MCP 架构</category><category>MCP</category><category>AI Tools</category><category>Architecture</category><category>Context Optimization</category></item><item><title>Vulkan 游戏中 DXGI/D3D12 Swapchain 的来源分析</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/04-vulkan-dxgi-d3d12-swapchain/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/04-vulkan-dxgi-d3d12-swapchain/</guid><description>Vulkan 游戏在抓帧或 Hook 时常能命中 DXGI/D3D12 Present。基于 nvoglv64.dll 的静态逆向，定位 NVIDIA 驱动把 Vulkan 渲染结果桥接到内部 DXGI/D3D12 呈现层的路径。</description><pubDate>Tue, 02 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Graphics</category><category>Vulkan</category><category>DXGI</category><category>D3D12</category><category>NVIDIA</category></item><item><title>从 Vulkan ICD 到 WDDM Miniport：NVIDIA Windows 图形驱动行为链静态分析</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/03-nvidia-graphics-driver-stack/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/03-nvidia-graphics-driver-stack/</guid><description>本文基于 NVIDIA Windows 图形驱动样本，梳理 Vulkan、OpenGL、D3D、DXGI 与 WDDM 之间的模块职责、接口边界与证据强度。</description><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Graphics</category><category>Vulkan</category><category>DXGI</category><category>D3D12</category><category>NVIDIA</category></item></channel></rss>